msgid "Puts the edge facing the track at the distance chosen from its axis, set back by the widening of the gauge in the curves.\nStands on the plane of the rail heads carried on to its edge: lower on the inner side of a canted curve,\nhigher on the outer one; on the inner side also set back by the cant times the height of the edge / 1.5"
